astructure\&quot;]\n        QueueDash[\&quot;📊 Queue Performance\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    Apps --&gt;|stdout/stderr| FluentBit\n    Apps --&gt;|metrics| CWAgent\n    Apps --&gt;|traces| XRayDaemon\n    \n    FluentBit --&gt; LogGroups\n    CWAgent --&gt; Metrics\n    XRayDaemon --&gt; XRay\n    \n    Metrics --&gt; Alarms\n    LogGroups --&gt; Dashboard\n    Metrics --&gt; Dashboard\n    XRay --&gt; Dashboard\n\n    classDef app fill:#326CE5,stroke:#fff,color:#fff\n    classDef agent fill:#FF9900,stroke:#232F3E,color:#000\n    classDef cw fill:#232F3E,stroke:#FF9900,color:#fff\n    classDef alarm fill:#B71C1C,stroke:#F44336,color:#fff\n\n    class UI,Query,Command app\n    class FluentBit,CWAgent,XRayDaemon agent\n    class LogGroups,Metrics,Retention cw\n    class HighCPU,HighMem,PodCrash,HighLatency alarm&quot;&#xa;}" id="kzNxQnAj0WQ0Ct0jcWqK-42">
